# Live Art Inc Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Live Art Inc and Liveart.market.

Live Art Inc is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as an NFT, digital art and exchange smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Live Art Inc  
Audit type: Artwork exchange smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Reports

[01_Certificate_Liveart.market.pdf](./01_Certificate_Liveart.market.pdf)

[02_Smart Contract Audit_LiveartMarket_Artwork_Exchange.pdf](./02_Smart%20Contract%20Audit_LiveartMarket_Artwork_Exchange.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work for digital art and exchange related infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to NFT infrastructure, digital art marketplaces and artwork exchange smart contracts.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
